WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.980
Now let's talk to it.

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.910
Tap the message box, tap the microphone,

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.350
and read the message on this screen out loud.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.330
Or tap Copy and paste it in.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.517
Then send it.

